<title>USA: Bridge View sets initial payout of $0.10.</title>
<headline>Bridge View sets initial payout of $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridge View Bankcorp said Monday directors declared an initial cash dividend of $0.10 per share payable February 1 to holders of record on January 15. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
